{"id":"n84939-1-12","stage":2,"title":"핵심 · 核心","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84939-1-12-1","ko":"너 시험공부는 많이 했니?","zh":"你考试复习得够多吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"시험공부는","meaning":"备考，考试复习","explanation":"시험공부：备考，考试复习；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시험공부","audio":"/audio/c914b5145dc029ff3787.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65757","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험공부는","audio":"/audio/53c290514c9c366a0111.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"했니?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했니","audio":"/audio/1889ab3866856ff3fbae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c914b5145dc029ff","term":"시험공부","zh":"备考，考试复习","audio":"/audio/c914b5145dc029ff3787.mp3","entryId":"65757","definition":"为了考好考试而学习。","pronunciation":["시험공부"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7ccbd35e071d03fadc59.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84939-1-12-2","ko":"아니, 시간이 없어서 교과서의 핵심 부분만 봤어.","zh":"没有，因为时间不够，只看了课本里的重点内容。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不是，不用，不要","explanation":"아니：不是，不用，不要。","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"없어서","meaning":"不足","explanation":"없다：不足；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"5","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어서","audio":"/audio/adaf4f61a45d9bd6ce5a.mp3"}},{"text":"교과서의","meaning":"教科书，教材","explanation":"교과서：教科书，教材；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"교과서","audio":"/audio/82ed6f2233350ed7b388.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28629","senseId":"1","lemma":"교과서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교과서의","audio":"/audio/547a398f79de4cdc3d87.mp3"}},{"text":"핵심","meaning":"核心","explanation":"핵심：核心。","readings":[{"term":"핵심","audio":"/audio/2667257de74764c7444b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84939","senseId":"1","lemma":"핵심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"핵심","audio":"/audio/2667257de74764c7444b.mp3"}},{"text":"부분만","meaning":"部分","explanation":"부분：部分；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"부분","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3"}],"sources":